From: Kirubagharan A S <kirubagharanas@ami.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Mar 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] sdbusplus: add C++20 fallback for std::move_only_function

std::move_only_function is a C++23 feature. Provide a C++20-compatible
fallback aliased to std::function so consumers built with -std=gnu++20
can compile against these headers.

Signed-off-by: Kirubagharan A S <kirubagharanas@ami.com>
---
 include/sdbusplus/asio/connection.hpp | 11 +++++++++++
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+)

diff --git a/include/sdbusplus/asio/connection.hpp b/include/sdbusplus/asio/connection.hpp
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/include/sdbusplus/asio/connection.hpp
+++ b/include/sdbusplus/asio/connection.hpp
@@ -8,6 +8,17 @@
 #include <systemd/sd-bus.h>
 #include <systemd/sd-event.h>
 
+// C++20 compatibility: std::move_only_function requires C++23.
+// Provide a fallback for toolchains building with -std=gnu++20.
+#if __cplusplus < 202302L
+#include <functional>
+namespace std
+{
+template <typename T>
+using move_only_function = std::function<T>;
+} // namespace std
+#endif
+
 namespace sdbusplus
 {
 namespace asio
-- 
